<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Allstate said raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Allstate said raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Donaldson, Lufkin and Jenrette raised its rating on Allstate Corp to outperform, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Allstate rose 3/8 to 49-1/8 in early trading.</p>
